Fixed in e4249b7 (local main, not pushed). _parse_timeout asks defined-and-length; '0', integer 0 and '00' are zero for claim_timeout and lock_timeout. t/232 pinned the old fallback for a bare 0 explicitly; that assertion is reversed there, per this card.
